## Requirements

| Requirement | Details |
|-------------|---------|
| Application model | SQLAlchemy model with shop_id, customer_id, service_id, application_number, status, assigned_staff_id, application_data (JSON), notes |
| Migration | Alembic migration creating applications table with indexes, FKs, check constraint |
| Schemas | ApplicationCreate, ApplicationUpdate, ApplicationResponse, ApplicationListResponse |
| Service layer | ApplicationService with create, get, list, update, assign_staff, update_status |
| RBAC | APPLICATION_VIEW, APPLICATION_CREATE, APPLICATION_UPDATE permissions |
| Tenant validation | All operations scoped to shop_id; cross-shop customer/service/staff rejected |
| Application number | Auto-generated: `{shop_code}-{year}-{6-digit-sequential}` with uniqueness guarantee |
| Status workflow | ENQUIRY (default) → APPLIED → DOCUMENTS_PENDING → UNDER_PROCESSING → COMPLETED/REJECTED/CANCELLED |
| Dynamic fields | Validate application_data against ServiceField definitions (required, type, options) |
| Staff assignment | Validate staff has active ShopMembership in same shop |
| API | REST endpoints: GET/POST /shops/{shop_id}/applications, GET/PATCH /shops/{shop_id}/applications/{id}, PATCH /assign, PATCH /status |
| Audit | Record create, update, assign, status_change with old/new values |
| Tests | Comprehensive async tests for all service methods and API endpoints |
| Frontend list | Search, filter, pagination, responsive table |
| Frontend create | Multi-step wizard (customer → service → staff → dynamic fields) |
| Frontend detail | View application with all details, status timeline |
| Frontend edit | Edit application data, notes, staff, status |
| Responsive testing | Mobile/tablet/desktop layouts |

